  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central America Digital Connectivity Workshop Training Series, through Koeppen, Elliot &amp; Associates, Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Central America Digital Connectivity Workshop Training Series consists of ten online workshops focused on U.S. technologies and best practices in the ICT sector that support priority ICT infrastructure projects in Costa Rica, El Salvador, Guatemala, and Honduras.</narrative>
  </description>
